    "title": "How do we calculate On Time Performance?",
    "updated_at": "2023-06-02T14:00:33Z",
    "description": "<ol><li data-renderer-start-pos=\"3126\" dir=\"ltr\">We calculate your punctuality figures by matching your static data with your AVL feeds. Please see \"How do we match Automatic Vehicle Location (AVL) data to schedules?\" for more information.</li><li data-renderer-start-pos=\"3316\">We DO NOT include no data instances in your figures</li><li data-renderer-start-pos=\"3369\">We DO NOT include last stops in your figures</li><li data-renderer-start-pos=\"3415\" dir=\"ltr\">We use the OTC definitions for early and late. Please see the Late, On-Time and Early sections for more information.</li></ol>",
    "description_text": "  We calculate your punctuality figures by matching your static data with your AVL feeds. Please see \"How do we match Automatic Vehicle Location (AVL) data to schedules?\" for more information.  We DO NOT include no data instances in your figures  We DO NOT include last stops in your figures  We use the OTC definitions for early and late. Please see the Late, On-Time and Early sections for more information.  ",
